abstract: >-
  Academic reference implementation for computing spectral colour-quality
  metrics (Ra, Rf, MCPI, CDM, MCPIr, CDMr, and related indices) from SPD data.
  Not an official national-standard publication.
keywords:
  - lighting quality
  - colour rendering
  - SPD
  - CIE
  - GB/Z
